triple in src/triple.ts is covered by a test that asserts nothing, and a `// Stryker disable
next-line all` comment sits above it. Stryker reports every mutant on line 2 as Ignored; the
adapter must score them as Survived, so the comment is no excuse and the case fails at that line.

